 "changed_since_previous": "Switched the parallelism CLI argument from a positional parameter to a named `--parallelism=<value>` option in the tool and documentation.",
 "card": "This PR optimizes the `deterministic-fuzz-coverage` devtool by comparing merged `.profdata` files directly between runs and skipping `llvm-cov show` rendering when profiles match byte-for-byte. This cuts execution time by roughly 3x for fuzz coverage determinism checks on large corpora (e.g., from ~12 minutes to ~4 minutes on process_message) by only rendering human-readable reports when a discrepancy is detected. It also updates the tool's CLI to accept `--parallelism=<value>` as a named flag.",
